      exampleInfo: !<string[]>
        - "Hand Goo: your thumb, index and middle fingertips and both palms are metaballs. Touch your fingers or bring your hands together and watch them melt."
        - "Pinch & Merge: Pinch an orb, drag it into another and squash them together. Released orbs drift back home."
        - "Lava Lamp: six wax blobs heat up at the bottom, rise, cool and sink, merging and splitting on the way."
        - "Assistant Orb: an AI-assistant orb that breathes when idle. Drag Intensity or press Excite to make it think."
        - "Style Lab: four orbiting balls. Switch looks with Prev / Next and tune smoothness, wobble and intensity."
